sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant G as Instrumented graph
    participant X as agxai
    participant B as LangGraphHumanInTheLoopBridge
    participant M as FeedbackManager
    actor Rev as Reviewer

    App->>G: ainvoke(input, config)
    G-)X: run paused (INTERRUPT)
    G-->>App: result with __interrupt__
    App->>B: request(interrupt, snapshot context)
    B->>M: submit REQUEST_FOR_HUMAN
    M-->>B: feedback RECEIVED
    Rev->>App: approve or reject
    App->>B: resolve(feedback_id, response, approved)
    B->>M: record decision
    App->>G: ainvoke(resume command)
    G-)X: resumed run (RESUME)
    G-->>App: final result
